    {
      "type": "Block",
      "value": "---\nesid: sec-Intl.Locale.prototype.getHourCycles\ndescription: >\n  When the locale has no region, the Add Likely Subtags algorithm is used to\n  derive the region whose hour cycle preference is returned.\ninfo: |\n  RegionPreference ( locale )\n  ...\n  2. If _region_ is *undefined*, then\n    a. Set _region_ to CanonicalUnicodeSubdivision(_locale_, *\"sd\"*).\n    b. If _region_ is *undefined*, then\n      i. Let _maximal_ be the result of the Add Likely Subtags algorithm applied\n         to _locale_. If an error is signaled, set _maximal_ to _locale_.\n      ii. Set _maximal_ to CanonicalizeUnicodeLocaleId(_maximal_).\n      iii. Set _region_ to GetLocaleRegion(_maximal_).\n      iv. If _region_ is *undefined*, then\n        1. Set _region_ to *\"001\"*.\n  ...\nfeatures: [Intl.Locale, Intl.Locale-info]\n---",
      "start": 124,
      "end": 930
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " In order not to rely on a particular implementation's locale data, this test",
      "start": 932,
      "end": 1011
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " searches for a suitable locale without a region subtag, but where the likely",
      "start": 1012,
      "end": 1091
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " region would influence the supported hour cycles.",
      "start": 1092,
      "end": 1144
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": "",
      "start": 1145,
      "end": 1147
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " Each candidate below is a language subtag together with the region that the",
      "start": 1148,
      "end": 1226
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " Add Likely Subtags algorithm derives for it (e.g. \"am\" maximizes to",
      "start": 1227,
      "end": 1297
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " \"am-Ethi-ET\", so \"am-ET\"). A language tag without a region, subdivision (\"sd\"",
      "start": 1298,
      "end": 1378
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " keyword), or region override (\"rg\" keyword) passed to RegionPreference must",
      "start": 1379,
      "end": 1457
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " apply Add Likely Subtags and arrive at the paired region. Its hour cycles",
      "start": 1458,
      "end": 1534
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " must therefore be identical to those of the candidate locale. An incorrect",
      "start": 1535,
      "end": 1612
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " implementation might instead fall back to the region \"001\" in step 2.b.iv.",
      "start": 1613,
      "end": 1690
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": "",
      "start": 1691,
      "end": 1693
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " We could assume even less about the locale data by not hardcoding these",
      "start": 1694,
      "end": 1768
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " likely regions and instead checking all available locales with the result of",
      "start": 1769,
      "end": 1848
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " maximize() on each one, but that assumes the implementation has a working",
      "start": 1849,
      "end": 1925
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " maximize(), and if that's the case then it probably implements this step",
      "start": 1926,
      "end": 2001
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " correctly as well.",
      "start": 2002,
      "end": 2023
    }
  ],
  "diagnostics": []
